# Logging, PII, Fastify

- Log via nestjs-pino / `AppLoggerService` only — no `console.log` / `console.error` in app code
- Never log OTP codes, magic-link tokens, JWTs, emails, passwords, or raw req/res bodies
- Do not bypass pino redaction in `src/logger/`
- Use Fastify types (`FastifyRequest` / `FastifyReply`), `@fastify/cookie`, and the octet-stream parser from `main.ts` — not Express APIs
- CORS origins come from config (`corsOrigins`); never `*` with credentials
